  "theorem_statement": "The fractions 7/13, 11/13, 12/13, and 13/7 are generated by a new projection layer P(A)=A/Phi3 and inverse projection P(A)^(-1), not by the Fibonacci/E6 mixer grammar.  This classifies Phi6/Phi3 as a threshold-field projection, (k-1)/Phi3 as a Hashimoto radial projection, k/Phi3 as a degree projection, and Phi3/Phi6 as an inverse threshold projection.",
